{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":144,"count":32,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L10-2-03\",\"頭髮\",\"頭髮\",\"头发\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"聽說坐月子時不能洗頭髮，要不然對身體不好，你相信這樣的說法嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-14","sourceFront":"說法","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"天空突然下起了大雨，我的衣服和頭髮都濕了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-20","sourceFront":"溼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的朋友會理頭髮，為了省錢我們常常去找他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-17","sourceFront":"理頭髮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的白髮隨著年齡越來越多了，我想找一天去染頭髮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-49","sourceFront":"染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從開始掉頭髮以後，醫師就建議他每天吃半顆維他命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-32","sourceFront":"顆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果想捐頭髮，長度至少要十五公分以上才能捐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-26","sourceFront":"捐","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"頭(head) + 髮(hair) → the hair on your head."},{"key":"[\"B1L10-2-08\",\"耳朵\",\"耳朵\",\"耳朵\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我感冒了，頭很痛，眼睛、耳朵也不舒服。","pinyin":"Wǒ gǎnmào le, tóu hěn tòng, yǎnjing, ěrduo yě bù shūfu.","english":"I caught a cold; my head hurts a lot, and my eyes and ears are also uncomfortable.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-09","sourceFront":"眼睛","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"以前學校規定女學生的髮型都要一樣，而且長度不能超過耳朵。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-18","sourceFront":"髮型","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"耳(ear) + 朵(suffix): the ear → 朵 just completes the word."},{"key":"[\"B1L16-1-12\",\"部\",\"部\",\"部\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我要買一部新電腦。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào mǎi yí bù xīn diànnǎo.","english":"I want to buy a new computer.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-09","sourceFront":"電腦","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我覺得這部電影很有趣，你覺得呢？","pinyin":"Wǒ juéde zhè bù diànyǐng hěn yǒuqù, nǐ juéde ne?","english":"I think this movie is very interesting. What do you think?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-05","sourceFront":"覺得","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"聽說這部電影很有趣，我們晚一起去看，好不好？","pinyin":"Tīngshuō zhè bù diànyǐng hěn yǒuqù. Wǒmen wǎnshang yìqǐ qù kàn, hǎo bù hǎo?","english":"I heard that this movie is very interesting. How about we go to see it tonight?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 咅(to spit out) hits an 阝(place) and splits it into one 部(part)."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-27\",\"一个人\",\"一個人\",\"一个人\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我覺得你一個人跟不認識的人見面，不太安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-14","sourceFront":"安全","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"天黑了，那個小孩子很害怕，不敢一個人去上廁所。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-18","sourceFront":"害怕","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"天黑了，那個小孩子很害怕，不敢一個人去上廁所。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-19","sourceFront":"敢","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我父母這個週末都不在家，家裡只剩下我一個人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-12","sourceFront":"剩下","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個老人年紀太大，沒辦法一個人生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-29","sourceFront":"老人","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"同事都走了，只剩下他一個人還在做事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-13","sourceFront":"做事","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他很勇敢，十五歲就離開父母，一個人到英國去留學了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-07","sourceFront":"離開","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我不曾一個人去旅行，總是參加團體旅遊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-07","sourceFront":"曾","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:謝謝你的幫助。沒有你的話， 我一個人很難完成新產品的廣告設計。 B:別這麼說。我們是同事，互相幫助是應該的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-44","sourceFront":"別這麼說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"購物時我喜歡一個人慢慢看，不太喜歡店員一直向我推銷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-08","sourceFront":"推銷","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"救災工作不容易，一個人的力量是不夠的，得大家一起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-26","sourceFront":"力量","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"跟團體旅遊比起來，我覺得一個人的旅行自由得多，也能訓練自己解決問題的能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-02","sourceFront":"旅行","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天藝術系的學生要在學校的禮堂，演出跟十二生肖有關的故事。 那名演員很厲害，在那部電影裡一個人演出三個角色。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-20","sourceFront":"演出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張太太一個人管三個孩子，家裡大大小小的事情也是她負責的，太辛苦了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-14","sourceFront":"管","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在那場車禍中，那個孩子失去了父母，家裡只剩下他一個人，大家都很同情他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-21","sourceFront":"同情","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:為什麼活動中心連一個人都沒有？今天不是有吉他社的表演嗎？ B:你搞錯了，演出日期是下個星期三。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-11","sourceFront":"搞","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"幸虧你來幫忙，要不然我一個人絕對忙不過來","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-29","sourceFront":"幸虧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一個人做錯事多半是自己造成的，不能一做錯就怪別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-34","sourceFront":"多半","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人說，想了解一個人的真心，就得看他做的事、他說的話。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-14","sourceFront":"真心","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一個人的想法會隨著身分、角色的不同而改變。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-18","sourceFront":"身分","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"身分證是用來證明一個人的身分時使用的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-21","sourceFront":"身分證","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一個人要學會儲蓄，需要用錢的時候，就不必擔心沒錢可用。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-22","sourceFront":"儲蓄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"資源回收不分你我他，一個人的回收是榜樣，一群人的回收是力量。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-01","sourceFront":"回收","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你來得正好，請你幫我檢查這些文件，我一個人實在做不來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-24","sourceFront":"正好","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那項新產品的設計圖你一個人負責太辛苦了，倒不如找同事一起來做。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-17","sourceFront":"倒不如","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司上頭要求小張一個人完成任務，同事們都認為有點兒勉強。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-22","sourceFront":"勉強","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有時一個人的前途無法先規劃好，必須自己創造。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-12","sourceFront":"前途","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不要僅根據表面來判斷一個人或一件事，得花時間深入瞭解。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-14","sourceFront":"判斷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一個人不管多有錢、多有地位，過世之後什麼也帶不走。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-08","sourceFront":"過世","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"