:"B4L09-1-24","sourceFront":"特別","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"中國人看傳統戲劇時都喜歡準備一盤瓜子，邊吃邊欣賞。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-39","sourceFront":"瓜子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"臺灣人常用花生、紅豆做傳統點心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-38","sourceFront":"花生","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那位服裝設計師相當喜愛十八世紀時的歐洲傳統風格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-02","sourceFront":"世紀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在古代中國，男人不應該進廚房的傳統觀念，也因為時代的改變而不同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-01","sourceFront":"時代","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"以電腦系統取代傳統收停車費的方式，能幫老闆節省工作人員的費用。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-05","sourceFront":"系統","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這次亞洲文化展，除了樂器表演，還有傳統服裝試穿活動，歡迎各位來參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-01","sourceFront":"各位","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"現代人往往以網路傳訊息，代替傳統寫信或打電話的方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-15","sourceFront":"往往","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"對華人來說，把書念好才有美好的未來，這個傳統觀念在臺灣已經慢慢改變了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-14","sourceFront":"觀念","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"臺灣南部不僅天氣好、旅遊景點多，還有各式各樣的傳統小吃，很值得去走走。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-02","sourceFront":"景點","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"照華人的傳統習慣，女人生完孩子就要坐月子，一直在家休息到孩子滿月。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-01","sourceFront":"坐月子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"何小姐習慣去傳統市場買水果，而且都跟同一個攤販買。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-07","sourceFront":"攤販","sourc